Z||000000||KRMFiero||11-18-2000||10:44 PM||||I have a 1984 Fiero se (2m4) and i want a sunroof or like t-tops or something, i have not found a t-top kit for it but i was told i can buy them.... anyways I want to put a sunroof in the fiero that DID NOT have one before... i saw one in JC whitney and they said it would not work on the fiero   why? <BR>i found a real nice on that I like at: <A HREF="http://www.accesscnc.com/F1100.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.accesscnc.com/F1100.html</A> <P>would this go on there? how come JC whitney and a few other places say it will not fit?<P>thank you||||reg||5
