Z||000002||Seanh||11-18-2000||11:24 PM||||You would probally have to put a roof from a sunroof Fiero on your car. I was wondering about somthing else while were on the topic of sunroof's. Can you put an electric sunroof on the Fiero? My other car has one and I really like it, you just move one switch to tilt up or down, and another to make it slid back much like removing the sunroof in the Fiero. Mine slids back into the roof, but I am sure the Fiero doesnt have the room to do that. Would there be any way to make it slid back ontop of the car, I think I have seen some cars like that around.<BR>Any Ideas?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"If you smoke after sex, you're doing it way to fast".</I>||||reg||1
